{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"average-calculator UI copy.method.paragraphs.4","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"average-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.4","keys":["average-calculator.copy.method.paragraphs.4"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Kinakailangan na huling grado assumes ang kasalukuyang grado ay sumasaklaw sa lahat ng trabaho bago ang huling. Ang formula ay (target × ZXQPH0000QXZ - kasalukuyang × (ZXQPH0001QXZ - huling timbang)) / huling timbang. Ang kasalukuyang at target na mga grado kasinungalingan mula sa zero sa isang daang, at ang huling timbang ay positibo.","record_id":"10e711b43795fb5175e1b58e7b5e3db9e67b3bc7f844f09171a65a6369523aed","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.7537347693750007,"source":"Required final grade assumes the current grade covers all work before the final. The formula is (target × 100 - current × (100 - final weight)) / final weight. The current and target grades lie from zero to one hundred, and the final weight is positive.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"e56bede094fe34ce1a9b66564f543f0582e6afdfae64fca828e3eac09fbeab32","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Kinakailangan na huling grado assumes ang kasalukuyang grado ay sumasaklaw sa lahat ng trabaho bago ang huling. Ang formula ay (target × 100 - kasalukuyang × (100 - huling timbang)) / huling timbang. Ang kasalukuyang at target na mga grado kasinungalingan mula sa zero sa isang daang, at ang huling timbang ay positibo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
